{"5232130":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"KanaCross Together","steam_appid":5232130,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>かなクロス \/ Kana Cross<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy word game played entirely in Japanese hiragana and katagana. Part word-battler, part gentle way to pick up kana and vocabulary — build real Japanese words, outscore a clever bot, and unwind in a warm little café.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kana Cross turns real vocabulary into play. Words are drawn from a real dictionary tagged by JLPT level (N5–N1), each shown with its meaning and kanji, so every match doubles as practice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🁢 Tile Board — Classic · Card · Special<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place hiragana tiles on the board to build crossing words, pick each tile's form as you go (か → か or が), and score every cross. Illegal plays just underline in red — no lost turns, so you're free to experiment.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong> — the pure word game: you, your rack, and a thinking opponent.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card <\/strong>— Classic plus 15 skill cards that swing whole games: steal tiles, drain points, seal a rack, lock down zones, or guarantee a ×3 finish.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special <\/strong>— Cards plus board events: treasure tiles, score bombs, rack shuffles, and lockdowns that turn a calm match into delightful mayhem.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.poster.avif?t=1793674906\" aria-label=\"War Mode : Include skill card to make advantage.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.webm?t=1793674906\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.mp4?t=1793674906\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▦ Puzzle — Relax · Time-Limit · Versus<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different rhythm: fill a ready-made board with the right words.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax<\/strong> — no clock, no pressure. Solve at your own pace.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Limit<\/strong> — race the countdown to fill as much of the board as you can.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus<\/strong> — you and an AI opponent fill the same board at once — claim words before they do.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👤 Single-Player &amp; 👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against a dictionary-smart bot — beginner to expert — or share the board with others. Team up or compete across the Tile Battle and Crossword modes, from a relaxed solo puzzle to a table full of rivals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Story Mode<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the café and learn to play the gentle way — a visual-novel intro sets the scene, introduces the character, and eases you into your first games before you head out on your own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/b7600f62d31c9f393e5261c20ea77078.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/0500420cb1ff05ea4f1313d0cbf84e9e.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/8744a24416669d593ef7c3c7337ef88b.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you'll love it<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to play: word-tile battles and fill-the-board crosswords<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three tile modes (Classic \/ Card \/ Special) + three crossword modes (Relax \/ Time-Limit \/ Versus)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Japanese as you play — JLPT-tagged dictionary with meanings &amp; kanji<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiragana \/ katakana script toggle, word history, and a saveable &quot;My Word&quot; list<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and multiplayer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, hand-made café aesthetic<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>かなクロス \/ Kana Cross<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy word game played entirely in Japanese hiragana and katagana. Part word-battler, part gentle way to pick up kana and vocabulary — build real Japanese words, outscore a clever bot, and unwind in a warm little café.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kana Cross turns real vocabulary into play. Words are drawn from a real dictionary tagged by JLPT level (N5–N1), each shown with its meaning and kanji, so every match doubles as practice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🁢 Tile Board — Classic · Card · Special<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place hiragana tiles on the board to build crossing words, pick each tile's form as you go (か → か or が), and score every cross. Illegal plays just underline in red — no lost turns, so you're free to experiment.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong> — the pure word game: you, your rack, and a thinking opponent.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card <\/strong>— Classic plus 15 skill cards that swing whole games: steal tiles, drain points, seal a rack, lock down zones, or guarantee a ×3 finish.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special <\/strong>— Cards plus board events: treasure tiles, score bombs, rack shuffles, and lockdowns that turn a calm match into delightful mayhem.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.poster.avif?t=1793674906\" aria-label=\"War Mode : Include skill card to make advantage.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.webm?t=1793674906\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/04f3266bf482f89a4f721eec8a28da3a.mp4?t=1793674906\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▦ Puzzle — Relax · Time-Limit · Versus<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A different rhythm: fill a ready-made board with the right words.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax<\/strong> — no clock, no pressure. Solve at your own pace.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-Limit<\/strong> — race the countdown to fill as much of the board as you can.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus<\/strong> — you and an AI opponent fill the same board at once — claim words before they do.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👤 Single-Player &amp; 👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against a dictionary-smart bot — beginner to expert — or share the board with others. Team up or compete across the Tile Battle and Crossword modes, from a relaxed solo puzzle to a table full of rivals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📖 Story Mode<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the café and learn to play the gentle way — a visual-novel intro sets the scene, introduces the character, and eases you into your first games before you head out on your own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/b7600f62d31c9f393e5261c20ea77078.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/0500420cb1ff05ea4f1313d0cbf84e9e.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/extras\/8744a24416669d593ef7c3c7337ef88b.avif?t=1793674906\" width=1024 height=576 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you'll love it<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two ways to play: word-tile battles and fill-the-board crosswords<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three tile modes (Classic \/ Card \/ Special) + three crossword modes (Relax \/ Time-Limit \/ Versus)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Japanese as you play — JLPT-tagged dictionary with meanings &amp; kanji<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiragana \/ katakana script toggle, word history, and a saveable &quot;My Word&quot; list<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and multiplayer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, hand-made café aesthetic<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A cozy word game played in Japanese hiragana and katagana. Build real words on a Crossword board, outscore a clever bot across Classic, Card, and Special Crossword tile board and Relax, Time-Limit, and Versus Crossword puzzle, and learn JLPT vocabulary as you play.","supported_languages":"English, German, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/1ce72f36678fa7cb788a9c96b838cfbc59e50f21\/header.jpg?t=1793674906","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/954dbae44d6cda7495ab385ef7e4bead2c229ee1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793674906","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5232130\/954dbae44d6cda7495ab385ef7e4bead2c229ee1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793674906","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Any dual-core x86-64, 2.0 GHz (e.g. Intel Core i3-2100 \/ AMD equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GPU with OpenGL 3.3 support (Intel HD 4000 \/ integrated graphics)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1024 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any DirectSound-compatible \/ on-board audio<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core x86-64, 2.5 GHz+<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Any dedicated GPU or modern integrated (Intel Iris Xe \/ equivalent)